    "### Detect Outliers using IQR\n",
    "**Method: Interquartile Range (IQR)**\n",
    "\n",
    "The IQR method defines outliers as values outside:\n",
    "\n",
    "`Q1 - 1.5×IQR`  and  `Q3 + 1.5×IQR`"
   ]
